Checks on data types are performed in two steps.
First date_rule_template_build.py creates a template for manual check /annotation:

 - read data_dictionary
 - filter adata_type == DATE
 - output a template CSV for manual annotation:
    - source_id
    - form
    - form_type
    - record_designation
    - dataelement_urn
    - data_element_designation
    - data_element_definition
    - data_format
    - rule_no_future
    - rule_not_before_DIB
    - rule_not_after_episode_date
    - rule_not_before_source_id
    - rule_not_after_source-id
